Mysterious desire is my only light,
The crowd is desire, burning through the night.
While the crowd is desire, hearts wild and free,
Scream "Process!" loud, let the fever be!
Build the crowd higher, feel the thunder rise,
Build the crowd higher, under stormy skies.
Build the crowd higher, let the echoes soar,
Build the crowd higher, forever wanting more.
Reaper calls soft, "Back to the future" low,
Sever the crowd, let the wild winds blow.
Holler "Lights out, brothers!" as the shadows creep,
The stage goes silent, but the spirit runs deep.
Music stays forever mysterious and true,
Some whisper stays forever mysterious too.
They burn and they never fade, through the endless fight,
Shout "Rock never dies" into the endless night!
